---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now — Thomas Miller"
  description="What I am writing, reading, and building right now."
  currentPath="/now"
>
  <div class="now-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="section-label">CURRENT FOCUS</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Now</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="now-link">now page</a>, inspired by Derek Sivers. Last updated February 2025.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="prose content-section">
      <h2>Writing</h2>
      <p>
        Drafting a monograph on <em>The Architecture of Quiet Interfaces</em>, exploring how the typography, layout constraints, and physical ergonomics of 19th-century printing presses can inform modern software environments.
      </p>

      <h2>Reading</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><em>The Craftsman</em> by Richard Sennett</li>
        <li><em>The Nature and Art of Workmanship</em> by David Pye</li>
        <li><em>Proust and the Squid: The Story and Science of the Reading Brain</em> by Maryanne Wolf</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Analog Practice</h2>
      <p>
        Testing various iron gall inks on Tomoe River paper using a vintage Pelikan 400 with an oblique broad nib. Experimenting with handwritten commonplace books for long-term knowledge retention.
      </p>

      <h2>Digital Setup</h2>
      <p>
        Running a minimal Arch Linux workstation inside an aluminum enclosure with no case lighting. Text editing is handled through Neovim in a monochrome terminal without statusline clutter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .now-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .now-link {
    color: var(--accent-terracotta);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-muted);
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .content-section {
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
